        "title_de": "Unberechtigter Zugriff nach Rollenwechsel oder Austritt",
        "description_en": "An employee whose role has changed or who has left the company retains access to sensitive data or systems due to a lack of access rights updates. This can lead to data breaches, manipulation, or sabotage.",
