        "priority": "must",
        "effort": "medium",
        "iso_ref": "ISO 27002:2022 A.5.30",
        "description_en": "Conduct annual or more frequent tests of the DRP, including simulated outages and recovery drills, to verify the plan's effectiveness and identify areas for improvement. Test results must be documented.",
        "title_en": "Regular Testing and Review of the DRP",
