        "priority": "must",
        "description_en": "Development and implementation of a detailed access control concept based on the 'need-to-know' principle. Access rights must be reviewed regularly and adjusted immediately upon role changes or departures.",
        "bsi_ref": "ORP.4.A8, ORP.4.A1",
        "title_en": "Access Control Concept for Records",
        "iso_ref": "ISO 27002:2022 A.5.15, A.5.16",
        "effort": "medium",
