        "typical_likelihood": 4,
        "cia": [
          "A"
        ],
        "title_en": "Undetected Vulnerabilities in Recovery Processes",
        "description_en": "Inadequate or missing documentation and evaluation of recovery tests lead to critical vulnerabilities in recovery processes remaining undetected, resulting in a complete or partial business outage in an emergency.",
