        "typical_likelihood": 2,
        "description_en": "Threat: Insufficiently secured laptops or mobile devices are stolen from workstations or unlocked offices. Impact: Loss of devices and the data stored on them, which can lead to significant financial damage, business interruptions, and compliance violations.",
