        "threat_category": "Compliance",
        "description_en": "Threat: Non-compliance with Clean Desk and Clear Screen policies and inadequate physical security of IT devices. Impact: Audit findings, fines, and legal consequences due to violations of data protection laws (e.g., GDPR) and industry-specific regulations.",
