        "priority": "must",
        "description_en": "Establish clear responsibilities and communication channels for immediate notification of relevant stakeholders (e.g., IT management, incident response team) upon discovery of critical vulnerabilities.",
        "bsi_ref": "ORP.4.A8",
        "title_en": "Definition of an escalation process for critical vulnerabilities",
